f-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897089#post897089\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Birds of prey are precision killers. They aren't bears. That's my point.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Go find a wild bird of prey and grab its leg or tail feathers, you will understand true fury that day...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T15:15:21-07:00","id":897250,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897213#post897213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Go find a wild bird of prey and grab its leg or tail feathers, you will understand true fury that day...</div> </div> </div> </div>Go watch how each hunt. It's not about fury. It's about control.<br /> <br /> A strix is a being removed from the platitudes of flesh. They can't even be reliably damaged. They have absolutely no reason to resort to fight or flight response when threatened.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T15:41:10-07:00","id":897269,"title":"","content":"They don't really <i>need</i> a reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T15:58:40-07:00","id":897284,"title":"","content":"No they don't.. but they also don't want to die. It's hard to have fun if you cease to exist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T16:17:22-07:00","id":897305,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897284#post897284\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No they don't.. but they also don't want to die. It's hard to have fun if you cease to exist.</div> </div> </div> </div>Did you skipped the part where I said &quot;They can't even be reliably damaged&quot;?<br /> <br /> Hell, for all the allusion to the idea that they're the Beast incarnate? They definitively lack the traits that characterizes it in vampires. Namely: Frenzy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T16:23:48-07:00","id":897317,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897305#post897305\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Did you skipped the part where I said &quot;They can't even be reliably damaged&quot;?<br /> <br /> Hell, for all the allusion to the idea that they're the Beast incarnate? They definitively lack the traits that characterizes it in vampires. Namely: Frenzy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I read it, I just know that it's bullshit, they can be hurt quite easily. the trick is knowing what can hurt them. Sort of like spirits almost haha.<br /> <br /> Why would you frenzy if there is no conflict between the Beast's urges and instincts and human nature? Mind you, this is merely my opinion, you don't have to agree with it if you don't want to.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T16:24:43-07:00","id":897319,"title":"","content":"Clearly the beast is a <i>really fucking angry</i> strix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T18:21:43-07:00","id":897403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897317#post897317\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I read it, I just know that it's bullshit, they can be hurt quite easily. the trick is knowing what can hurt them. Sort of like spirits almost haha.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Regular\">Strix don\u2019t fall unconscious no matter how much damage<br /> they\u2019ve suffered, and are only destroyed when all Corpus boxes<br /> are filled by aggravated damage.<br /> Injury is an extremely rare sensation for a Strix. They are<br /> completely immune to all physical and ephemeral attacks except<br /> for Disciplines and Devotions that inflict aggravated damage,<br /> which inflict Bashing wounds on them instead. Some banes<br /> inflict injury as well, notably sunlight and fire if the Strix is<br /> unable to escape.<br /> Aggravated and lethal wounds on a Strix in Shadow Form<br /> also cause it to lose Vitae \u2014 one per box filled.<br /> When a Strix possesses a host, all injury is suffered by the<br /> host rather than the Strix.</span></span><br /> <br /> Blood &amp; Smoke, pg 202. Not what I'd call easily hurt. Not at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T18:33:57-07:00","id":897411,"title":"","content":"That is pretty easily hurt to me, look at all those things they take damage from. I do not see many invulnerabilities. Formidable, yes. Super easily killed though. Then again, fire is the answer to everything in cofd... to an unfair degree","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 05-23-2016, 09:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T18:40:27-07:00","id":897417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897411#post897411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is pretty easily hurt to me, look at all those things they take damage from. I do not see many invulnerabilities.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">\u221e</span></span></span>-4 = ridiculously large number of invulnerabilities.<br /> <br /> edit: Oh, and don't forget even setting them on fire still deals no damage. It has to be completely covered in fire and then it only takes one point of damage every minute.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm surprised people don't think they have any rage.... They are described as having &quot;eternal anger&quot; and seem to hate basically everything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 05-23-2016, 09:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T18:46:16-07:00","id":897424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897411#post897411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is pretty easily hurt to me, look at all those things they take damage from. I do not see many invulnerabilities. Formidable, yes. Super easily killed though. Then again, fire is the answer to everything in cofd... to an unfair degree</div> </div> </div> </div>They only take bashing. To kill one takes to do triple their corpus in damage, and their banes might not even refer to an actual method of harm, so much as to duplicate vampiric quirks. Oh and they can fly and become immaterial. Escape for them is a virtual non-issue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T18:52:14-07:00","id":897428,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897417#post897417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">\u221e</span></span></span>-4 = ridiculously large number of invulnerabilities.</div> </div> </div> </div>To use a fun analogy; Shedninja has a ridiculously large number of Invulnerabilities, thanks to WonderGuard, yet it is horrifically vulnerable to a small number of types.<br /> <br /> The Strix are Shedninja, when it comes to being vulnerable. Utilize their banes, and they are ecen more fucked than their fleshy kindred relatives. Invulnerabilities are only impressive if you do not have an easily exploited weakness.<br /> <br /> Fighting a Strix is hard. Killing it is laughably easy.<br /> <br /> Which is why werewolf body = pretty good deal to me lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 05-23-2016, 09:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T18:56:07-07:00","id":897431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897424#post897424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They only take bashing. To kill one takes to do triple their corpus in damage, and their banes might not even refer to an actual method of harm, so much as to duplicate vampiric quirks. Oh and they can fly and become immaterial. Escape for them is a virtual non-issue.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fire is solid and presents an unbreachable barrier for Strix like sunlight. Immerse them in flame, there is no escape for them and they helplessly burn and die unless there is an opening for escape. (Such as dousing them with water)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T18:56:52-07:00","id":897432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897428#post897428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> To use a fun analogy; Shedninja has a ridiculously large number of Invulnerabilities, thanks to WonderGuard, yet it is horrifically vulnerable to a small number of types.<br /> <br /> The Strix are Shedninja, when it comes to being vulnerable. Utilize their banes, and they are ecen more fucked than their fleshy kindred relatives. Invulnerabilities are only impressive if you do not have an easily exploited weakness.<br /> <br /> Fighting a Strix is hard. Killing it is laughably easy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except that isn't true. Using there banes still barely does anything to them unless you have them in broad daylight (ridiculously rare and more chance of it screwing the vampire characters than the strix). Even setting them on fire still deals no damage, it has to be completely covered in fire and then it only takes one point of damage every minute.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T19:05:53-07:00","id":897445,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897432#post897432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Except that isn't true. Using there banes still barely does anything to them unless you have them in broad daylight (ridiculously rare and more chance of it screwing the vampire characters than the strix). Even setting them on fire still deals no damage, it has to be completely covered in fire and then it only takes one point of damage every minute.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure how this makes my statement incorrect to be honest, as that is still a very easy way to kill one, all things considered. You must understand this; I do not view the strix as overly invulnerable and can't really see them as such due to such basic banes. Yes they are tough to simply fight, I am not disputing this, but their invulnerablilties mean very little when they can be destroyed so easily by something as simple as fire. You can disagree and I respect that. I simply see it differently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 05-23-2016, 10:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T20:01:16-07:00","id":897502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/894191-strix-possessed-werewolf?p=897431#post897431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fire is solid and presents an unbreachable barrier for Strix like sunlight. Immerse them in flame, there is no escape for them and they helplessly burn and die unless there is an opening for escape. (Such as dousing them with water)</div> </div> </div> </div>Because this is a surefire and safe thing to do. That will call nobody's attention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T20:04:52-07:00","id":897507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-n